GRPO v5 Standard (negative control) — identical params to RASP GRPO v5: beta=0.01, temp=0.4, rep_penalty=1.15, format_reward=0.1, max_completion_length=512, gradient_checkpointing=True, monkey-patch ref_model. Direct comparison with grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v5. If RASP >> Standard, confirms CKA-aware pruning preserves RLVR-recoverable structures.（准备中）\\\\n- alpha_ablation_westd_cal256: α ablation sweep (calibration=256, N=100). α∈{0.0,0.5,1.0,2.0,4.0} at 20% sparsity. Phase A (prune+eval) complete, Phase B (SFT) in progress. Note: calibration=256 differs from westb original (512), causing ~5% group selection differences.（准备中）\\\\n- mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4: CKA functional overlap F(h) predicts structured pruning recoverability under RLVR. RASP scoring S(h)=I(h)×(1-F(h))^α selects structures whose removal is more recoverable via GRPO RLVR than standard importance-only pruning. V4: Dual sparsity probe (20% + 25%) to find viable operating point where pruned models retain >5% accuracy, then GRPO recovery comparison.（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **eval-sft-alpha-0p0** (success): —\\\\n- **grpo_stage2_standard_20_v7** (failed): D030: GRPO v7 — v6 OOM fix. 8-bit AdamW optimizer (bitsandbytes) saves ~50% optimizer memory. max_steps=100 (~756s/step). All other params same as v6: max_completion_length=1024, beta=0.01, temp=0.4, rep_penalty=1.15, format_reward=0.1, gradient_checkpointing=True, monkey-patch ref_model. ← 基于 sft_standard_20_retrain\\\\n- **grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v7** (failed): D030: GRPO v7 — v6 OOM fix. 8-bit AdamW optimizer (bitsandbytes) saves ~50% optimizer memory. max_steps=100 (~756s/step). All other params same as v6: max_completion_length=1024, beta=0.01, temp=0.4, rep_penalty=1.15, format_reward=0.1, gradient_checkpointing=True, monkey-patch ref_model. ← 基于 sft_rasp_20\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 7 / 负向 5 / 失败 10 / 共 28\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestb-23072: 无 GPU 信息\\\\nwestd-11672: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_rasp_pipeline: